// Enemy definitions, embedded into the game at compile time (see logic/enemies.rs).
//
// health / speed / radius / contact_dps: base values before difficulty scaling
// xp, gold:       dropped when the enemy dies
// spawn:          the enemy appears once `from` seconds of difficulty time have passed;
//                 its spawn weight is `base + per_second * time`
// ranged:         None for melee-only enemies, otherwise how the enemy shoots
//                 (min_range / max_range: preferred distance, projectiles x spread: a fan)
